## Exercise 1: The Sign

Print these three lines, exactly:

```
KAREL'S DINER
Open 24 hours
The sign says "Beepers Welcome"
```

Line one contains an apostrophe. Line three contains a pair of double quotes. Neither one is going to work if you reach for the wrong fence.

